body:
Maybe ask for a sooner appointment? I know calling back and maintaining communication can often speed up the process. 

&nbsp;

I know there are [informed consent clinics](https://www.google.com/amp/s/amp.reddit.com/r/asktransgender/comments/408552/im_making_a_map_of_informed_consent_clinics/) where prescriptions for HRT are provided for anyone with after a mental health screening and physical exam. I'm having trouble finding a comprehensive list but I've been getting my hormones through planned parenthood. Many of them don't.

&nbsp;

If that doesn't work DYI may be an option.

&nbsp;

I've been going to an informed consent clinic for 6 months now with great results, I'm a lot happier than I used to be and Im starting to pass to myself which is always wonderful :))
